            "Missing, illegible, or inconsistent certificate",
            "Damaged, wet, open, contaminated, or compromised packaging",
            "Quantity, weight, count, or unit-of-measure discrepancy",
            "Shelf-life, temperature, or controlled-storage exception",
            "Failed dimensional, physical, chemical, or visual requirement",
            "Mixed supplier lots or untraceable containers",
            "Required sampling or test could not be completed"
          ],
          "guidance": "Select every applicable exception and preserve the original observation."
